WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:09.498
Hi! Blend c, a, t together and you get cat! Today we'll blend 3-letter words and find rhymes.

2
00:00:09.648 --> 00:00:16.002
Many short words are consonant, vowel, consonant. We call them CVC words.

3
00:00:16.152 --> 00:00:20.178
Say each sound, then blend: c, a, t, cat.

4
00:00:20.328 --> 00:00:22.650
P, i, g, pig.

5
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:28.818
Change the middle vowel and you get a new word: cat becomes cut.

6
00:00:28.968 --> 00:00:33.426
Words that end with the same sound rhyme: cat, hat, mat.

7
00:00:33.576 --> 00:00:36.330
Pig, big and dig all rhyme.

8
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:40.770
Check whether the last two letters match: -at, -ig.

9
00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:46.458
Hot and hat start the same but end differently, so they don't rhyme.

10
00:00:46.608 --> 00:00:50.274
Watch out! Cat and car don't rhyme!

11
00:00:50.424 --> 00:00:53.874
Rhymes depend on the ending: cat ends in at.

12
00:00:54.024 --> 00:00:58.770
Hat also ends in at, so cat and hat rhyme.

13
00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:07.986
Your turn! Blend d, o, g. What word is it? Pause and think.

14
00:01:08.136 --> 00:01:13.530
D, o, g: dog. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:21.762
Another one! Which word rhymes with sun? Pause and think.

16
00:01:21.912 --> 00:01:27.186
Sun and run both end in un. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:27.336 --> 00:01:35.514
Here's another! Which word rhymes with pen? Pause and think.

18
00:01:35.664 --> 00:01:40.938
Pen and ten both end in en. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:41.088 --> 00:01:50.082
Try one more! Blend b, e, d. What word is it? Pause and think.

20
00:01:50.232 --> 00:01:55.050
B, e, d: bed. Did you get it right?

21
00:01:55.200 --> 00:02:04.938
Try one more! C, ___, p. What is the middle sound in cup? Pause and think.

22
00:02:05.088 --> 00:02:10.362
The middle sound in cup is u. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:10.512 --> 00:02:18.570
Try one more! Which word does not rhyme? Pause and think.

24
00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:25.026
Log and fog end in og; leg doesn't. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:25.176 --> 00:02:34.602
Try one more! Change the a in hat to i. What word do you get? Pause and think.

26
00:02:34.752 --> 00:02:39.978
H, i, t: hit. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:40.128 --> 00:02:48.186
Last one! Which word rhymes with cap? Pause and think.

28
00:02:48.336 --> 00:02:53.826
Cap and map both end in ap. Did you get it right?

29
00:02:53.976 --> 00:02:58.986
Remember: blending joins the sounds; rhymes share the same ending.

30
00:02:59.136 --> 00:03:04.985
Play a rhyme chain with your family: cat, hat, mat!

